00:43:43,740 --> 00:43:47,500
This is one of the most accurate thermometers in the world.

666
00:43:48,380 --> 00:43:52,480
This thermometer can measure up to 420 degrees C.

667
00:43:52,481 --> 00:43:55,280
This thermometer uses pure platinum wire,

668
00:43:55,281 --> 00:43:58,080
where you measure the resistance of that wire that changes

669
00:43:58,180 --> 00:43:59,520
as a function of temperature.

670
00:43:59,620 --> 00:44:01,720
The digital thermometer in your medicine cabinet

671
00:44:01,820 --> 00:44:04,520
uses the same principle and achieves accuracy

672
00:44:04,620 --> 00:44:07,720
within 1 1⁄2 degree.

673
00:44:07,820 --> 00:44:10,820
Platinum resistance thermometers are the instruments of choice

674
00:44:10,920 --> 00:44:12,640
