675
00:44:12,740 --> 00:44:18,840
from the core of a submarine to lava to your home oven,

676
00:44:18,940 --> 00:44:23,380
grains of wheat to kilograms, sundials to atomic clocks,

677
00:44:23,381 --> 00:44:26,820
the length of a human foot to the speed of light.

678
00:44:26,920 --> 00:44:29,920
As we strive to calculate more perfect measurements,

